    },
    {
      "id": "claim_478fb91affae4bd5a293b64f491005e0",
      "statement": "LlamaCppProvider normalizes AgentForge history into OpenAI-compat format for llama.cpp: assistant tool_calls gain call_N ids, stringified arguments, and type function, and tool result messages are back-filled with matching tool_call_id in order.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/providers/llamacpp.py#L87-L142",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:510bbbf2faf8aa6c35067ae0d65a4041ea8a6b43133bb3292f550cc89dae9618:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7f365b2e4c39489b91b70c02161b42dd",
      "statement": "LLAMACPP_THINKING_BUDGET controls thinking in the llama.cpp payload via chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking: 0 (default) disables it with max_tokens 8192, while N>0 enables thinking and raises max_tokens to N+8192, since /no_think in user messages does not work on llama.cpp.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/providers/llamacpp.py#L162-L178",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a5bffb1cc8f85b71a330c7d6f2882c82661b1662f3fc2422de50efbb8eb75e26:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8a69f920e4144c9b98cc77e557026eb4",
      "statement": "LlamaCppProvider aborts a stream early in two cases: a loop guard when more than LLAMACPP_LOOP_GUARD_TOKENS (default 6000) tokens have been decoded with no content and no tool_calls committed, and a repetition guard when a line of at least 20 characters repeats LLAMACPP_REPETITION_THRESHOLD (default 6) times in the accumulated content tail, covering templates that leak thinking into content.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/providers/llamacpp.py#L17-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5785dcc010481e5150261a3d67640f54e07d3215c01a83d142b18126005fb2cc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/agentforge/providers/llamacpp.py#L271-L311",
